<title>FRANCE: BASKETBALL-PANATHINAIKOS BEAT VILLEURBANNE IN EUROLEAGUE.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-PANATHINAIKOS BEAT VILLEURBANNE IN EUROLEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a EuroLeague basketball group C match on Wednesday: Villeurbanne (France) 74 Panathinaikos (Greece) 80 (halftime 30-43)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Delaney Rudd 27, Jim Bilba 15, Georgy Adams 9, Brian Howard 9.</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - Frangiskos Alvertis 25, John Amaechi 23, Nikos Ekonomou 15.</p>
</text>
